{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Completion handler called when an operation fails."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshframework\/pushwoosherrorhandler"]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshframework\/pushwoosherrorhandler"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PushwooshErrorHandler"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PushwooshErrorHandler","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:PushNotificationManager.h@T@PushwooshErrorHandler","title":"PushwooshErrorHandler","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshFramework"}],"symbolKind":"typealias","roleHeading":"Type Alias"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS\/documentation\/PushwooshFramework\/PushwooshErrorHandler"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PushwooshErrorHandler"},{"kind":"text","text":" = ((any "},{"text":"Error","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP"},{"kind":"text","text":")?) -> "},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This closure is called when a Pushwoosh operation fails, providing an error object describing what went wrong.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The handler receives an optional ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter. If the error is ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the operation succeeded (though typically success handlers use different callback types)."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Example","text":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handle tag setting errors with retry logic:"}]},{"code":["func setUserPreferences(_ preferences: [String: Any], retryCount: Int = 0) {","    let errorHandler: PushwooshErrorHandler = { error in","        if let error = error {","            self.logger.error(\"Failed to set tags: \\(error.localizedDescription)\")","","            if retryCount < 3 {","                DispatchQueue.main.asyncAfter(deadline: .now() + 2.0) {","                    self.setUserPreferences(preferences, retryCount: retryCount + 1)","                }","            } else {","                self.showAlert(title: \"Sync Error\", message: \"Could not save preferences. Please try again later.\")","            }","        }","    }","","    Pushwoosh.configure.setTags(preferences, onFailure: errorHandler)","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS\/documentation\/PushwooshFramework"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS\/documentation\/PushwooshFramework\/PushwooshGetTagsHandler"]}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS/documentation/PushwooshFramework/PushwooshErrorHandler":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Completion handler called when an operation fails."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PushwooshErrorHandler","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS\/documentation\/PushwooshFramework\/PushwooshErrorHandler","title":"PushwooshErrorHandler","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshframework\/pushwoosherrorhandler","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PushwooshErrorHandler"}]},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS/documentation/PushwooshFramework/PushwooshG